WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.630
College provides a great opportunity for students to explore various possibilities and find the right path for themselves.
大学为学生提供了绝佳的机会，让他们去探索各种可能性，找到适合自己的道路。

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:22.350
Unlike high school, where most of their time is devoted to preparing for exams, college offers a wide range of courses, clubs and activities, along with much more free time.
高中时，学生的大部分时间都用来备考；大学则不同，它提供了丰富多样的课程、社团和活动，还有多得多的空闲时间。

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.920
Making good use of this opportunity requires an open mind.
要利用好这个机会，需要有开放的心态。

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:34.900
Students can take elective courses outside their major, join clubs that interest them or do internships in different fields.
学生可以选修本专业以外的课程，参加自己感兴趣的社团，或者到不同的领域去实习。

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:41.020
Through such attempts, they gradually discover what they are good at and what they truly enjoy.
通过这样的尝试，他们会逐渐发现自己擅长什么、真正喜欢什么。

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:50.170
My roommate, for example, majored in chemistry but found during a volunteer teaching program that he loved working with children.
例如，我的室友主修化学，却在一次志愿支教项目中发现自己喜欢和孩子们打交道。

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:55.690
He later decided to pursue a career in education and has never been happier.
后来，他决定从事教育事业，如今比以往任何时候都快乐。

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:02.470
Even an attempt that does not work out is valuable, because it shows students which path is not for them.
即使是没有成功的尝试也是有价值的，因为它让学生知道哪条路不适合自己。

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:07.110
Of course, exploration should not become aimless wandering.
当然，探索不应变成漫无目的的游荡。

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:13.040
Students need to reflect on their experiences regularly and narrow down their choices.
学生需要经常反思自己的经历，并缩小选择范围。

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:21.670
By combining bold exploration with careful reflection, they can make the most of their college years and find a path that really suits them.
把大胆的探索与认真的反思结合起来，他们就能充分利用大学时光，找到真正适合自己的道路。
